## EntityId's encode what entity another entity is pointing to
```catala
declaration enumeration EntityId:
  -- E1
  -- E2
  -- E3
  -- E4
  -- E5
  -- E6
  -- E7
  -- E8
  -- E9
  -- E10
```

```catala
declaration enumeration IPId:
  -- IP1
  -- IP2
  -- IP3
```

```catala
declaration structure Entity:
  data id content EntityId
  data revenue content money
  data incorporation_jurisdiction content Jurisdiction
  data managememnt_jurisidiction content Jurisdiction
```

```catala
declaration enumeration Jurisdiction:
  -- Ireland
  -- Bermuda
  -- Netherlands
  -- US
  -- Germany
```



```catala
declaration scope EntityTax:
  input entity content Entity
  
  output entity_tax content money
    state base
    state with_deduction
```
